WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:07,280
Divine rock tree, divine character cultivation, unfathomable

2
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,160
What is this sacred rock tree?

3
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,840
No one is a sage, no one can make mistakes without practice

4
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:15,000
When conscience is magnified to the extreme

5
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
any monstrous fault

6
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,880
It will become a mountain that crushes you

7
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,060
I've been hanging around for so many years

8
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:37,340
Stupidly enduring the disaster without even saying a single word to seize the opportunity

9
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:39,460
Shenzi has no interest in joining our thumb

10
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:42,100
Do you follow the order of God to kill?

11
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:43,660
Are you a god or a devil?

12
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:47,060
I just give them a chance to live a new life

13
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:50,020
Let me go. I even believe that God has done something good for him.
